### Simulation

Standalone multi-mode lattice (no `scp_sim` / no Higgs field):

| DOF | update |
|-----|--------|
| `z_{iα}` | resonant 1:1 + 2:1 + intra-cell 1+2↔3 |
| `θ_i` | overdamped pull to `θ_eq(I)` + elastic Laplacian |

Falsifiers: continuous amplitude family only; no multi-seed recurrence; strong m-sensitivity; identical to `m=1` detune control; unbounded coarsening; no phase lock.

```bash
gcc -O3 -march=native -fopenmp -o v88/fabric_harmonic v88/fabric_harmonic.c -lm
./v88/fabric_harmonic quench 3 42
```

Schedules: `smoke|quench|thermal|cyclic|driven|staged|coalesce|detune`.

