### Species / annealing

Fingerprint: `(N_c, binned s_α, lock vector n̂)`. Candidates S2/S3 (locked multi-mode), not S1 (single-mode = breather danger).  
**P1 (falsifiable):** ≥2 fingerprint peaks recurring in ≥3 seeds with CV(N_c)<0.15.  
Anneals as specified; success = **recurrence across independent seeds**.

