### Preliminary instrument note (not a result)

Smoke: action stable (~3×10⁻⁴). One quench seed: lumps form and densify, but **n_lumps fell 10→3 by T=400** (coarsening open) and long-time E/action growth needs a Manley–Rowe audit before physics claims. **No multi-seed recurrence yet.**

Code debt is listed in design §9; next useful runs are multi-seed quench vs `detune`, then coarsening T→1600.
